    {
        "text": "9:00 A.M. / Overcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "14 hours before the attack on L. G. D. Headquarters"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Bad Guy' - 300 Meters above 'District 14' of Chernobog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mission objective: Join forces with Rhodes Island to rescue the reconnaissance team"
    },
    {
        "text": "Assigned assets:"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Bad Guy' and its pilot; Rhodes Island elite operator Blaze and her team."
    },
    {
        "text": "14 individuals."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_aircraft",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "daley",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is your stop. Amiya and her people are nearby!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it really okay to drop the team outside the city? You're gonna go down there by yourself?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, it's a lot better for them to be out there clearing a path and pushing back Reunion's pursuit forces than to fight here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay. The terrain down there is pretty rough. This is as far as I can take you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "...At least let me put down a rope for you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "When have you ever seen me use a rope?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just gonna go for it again, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go for what? What are you talking about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every time we have a mission together, you go off and do crazy stuff while I sit in the cockpit on pins and needles and watch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm kind of used to it, but that doesn't change the fact that you're way too reckless out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "That just goes to show you what a good rapport you, me, and my team have!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rapport my ass! Last time you demolished a town, bombed out a reservoir, and collapsed a mine!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep the chaos on the ground please, don't bring it onto my baby!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, fine. I got it. But, 'Bad Guy,' really? Maybe think a little harder next time you pick a name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just jump already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think the welcoming committee's spotted us. This is where we say goodbye, Blaze.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "No problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll wait for you by the entrance to the ruins. Be quick!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? The comms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "HELLO?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can hear you! You don't have to yell!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. Hi, Rhodes Islanders. I'm with the L. G. D. I've met up with your team by the ruins!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't the L. G. D. withdraw already? What are you trying to pull?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not like that Ch'en lady! Trust me, I can help you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "And how should we call you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Use my codename. Call me Officer Swire!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't Swire just your name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze, can you take care of this? I'm not good with bureaucrats...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "text": "......Blaze?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't look at me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Get back here! Don't jump!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you tell me to jump a second ago? You can handle this. I believe in you! *Mwah*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mwah my ass!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pilot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "time": 1
