        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Pant* *pant*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Is she okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, it's nothing serious. Just her body temperature's a little low.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's always... low. I'm fine. I just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Frostleaf, slow down. Your temperature is even lower than usual.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, pass me a bandage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Here.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you, I'm fine. Meteorite got hit a lot harder.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay. I'm a Sarkaz. I'm more worried about you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Jessica, what is Yeti Squad doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Th- they're approaching our position! About 500 meters out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the debris clearing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need about fifteen more minutes. The collapsed building has a pretty complicated superstructure and we can't risk blasting here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Meteorite, get ready to fight. We have to hold this line.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Roger. Do we have a stock of bolts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Logistics can get them for you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, are you there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...guh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did somebody leave their comms open?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the elite operators' channel, I can open it from my end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "That voice...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh no. They sent her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#2",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... who is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Yes, who is this? And what's got her so excited?;......;Can she really make a difference here?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They call her Blaze. She can certainly level the whole area and leave everyone pissing themselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn right it's me! But that last part is a little off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please... let's be serious here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you, Blaze? We need your support.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm right above you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just about 200 meters to go and I'll be there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't hit the machine, it's out of range!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Flying machines... they have such equipment?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Make sure they do not come down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wipe out the Rhodes Island squad before their reinforcements arrive. They cannot be allowed to join forces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014\u2014Stand back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She jumped again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She jumped again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "We can jump together sometime, Amiya! If you want.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think I'll take a rain check. Where's your team?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "I left them outside the city. They'll be here in a bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't hear anything over the wind. Turn off your comms!",
        "tag": "name",
